Cell["Perturb a circular orbit at r0 with a small radial kick.", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"92247704-9ade-4241-964d-9d6b370586a2"],

Cell["\<\
Circular orbit at r0: V_eff'(r0)=0.  Stable if V_eff''(r0)>0.  ISCO at r=6M.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6d1170ec-41b8-4da0-8845-1f1a9562ca36"],

